# Title: Suspicious Curl File Upload - Linux
# ID: 00b90cc1-17ec-402c-96ad-3a8117d7a582
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems), Cedric MAURUGEON (Update)
# Date: 2022-09-15
# Tags: attack.exfiltration, attack.command-and-control, attack.t1567, attack.t1105
# Description: Detects a suspicious curl process start the adds a file to a web request
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((((CommandLine CONTAIN " --form" OR CommandLine CONTAIN " --upload-file " OR CommandLine CONTAIN " --data " OR CommandLine CONTAIN " --data-")) OR (CommandLine=regex("\\s-[FTd]\\s"))) AND (Image="*/curl")) AND NOT (((CommandLine CONTAIN "://localhost" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "://127.0.0.1"))))
